{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "ShadChat",
      "name": "ShadChat",
      "description": "ToolJet UI 2.0 chat: the native Chat widget's properties, events, exposed values and actions in the pack's look. Message rows with an avatar (an image URL, else initials) and the sender's name; the user's turns sit on the right in an accent bubble, replies on the left with markdown (lists, tables, code). A new user turn moves near the top of the view and the reply grows below it; scrolled up, the view stays where the reader is and a Jump to latest button appears. loadingResponse shows a typing indicator, loadingHistory skeleton rows. A message is { message, type: 'message' (user) | 'response' | 'error', name, avatar, timestamp, messageId }. Wire onMessageSent to a query that reads components.<chat>.lastMessage.message and appends its answer with the appendHistory action ({ message, type: 'response' }), with setResponseLoading around it. Height: fixed (the messages scroll); give it 400 to 700px",
      "defaultSize": {
        "width": 15,
        "height": 480
      },
      "properties": [
